## ISP Billing SaaS, MikroTik, Hotspot Zone, Automatic Vouchers, Multi-Domain Website Builder, Visual CMS & Interactive Demos

**Platform:** WIFI Pay  
**Primary domain:** `wifipay.cyou`  
**Additional website domains:** `mrwht.bond`, `ispbd.cyou`  
**Deployment target:** Existing production project and its configured hosting infrastructure  
**Objective:** Build a complete, secure, multi-tenant ISP billing and hotspot management SaaS with automatic ISP website creation, visual website editing, payment integrations, customer portals and interactive public demos.

This is an extension of the existing WIFI Pay application, not a new standalone demo.

First inspect the entire existing codebase, framework, routes, database, authentication, ISP dashboard, super-admin panel, payment integrations, MikroTik integrations, deployment configuration and environment variables. Preserve working functionality. Implement missing functionality in compatible stages.

