## 11. Hotspot Zone Management

Hotspot Zone is a central feature of WIFI Pay and must receive prominent placement in the product and demo experience.

Allow each ISP to configure multiple hotspot zones, where supported by its network architecture.

Each zone should include:

- Zone name.
